cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "WB_quantifier: interactive Western blot densitometry tool"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Kemble-Diaz"
    given-names: "Cambrin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2389-0639"
repository-code: "https://github.com/camKD98/WB_quantifier"
abstract: "Interactive Tkinter/Matplotlib GUI for per-lane ROI densitometry of Western blot images: 1-D intensity profiles, local background-median baselines, trapezoidal integration with user-defined or automatic bounds, and optional constrained single-peak Gaussian reconstruction. Developed for quantification of HUVEC pFAK(Tyr397)/total-FAK/actin blots."
keywords: [western blot, densitometry, gel analysis, reproducibility, Tkinter]
